	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non habeo, quod scribam, aliud quam turbas tristissimas, doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>omnium prope urbium liberarum <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName>, quae iam prope omnes dira servitute laborant <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non rerum modo et corporum, sed etiam (quod longe maxime dolet et excruciat) conscientiarum, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quas mire premit et distrahit liber ille sacer a <persName ref="p18538">Caesare</persName> aeditus, qui sane contra <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>omnium expectationem et contra fidem (ut ferunt) omnibus datam ita urget nostros et cogit, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ut, quam ille pacificationem partium tam sancte est pollicitus, nulla prorsus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>parte praestet et ita probet papisticam, ut, ubi etiamnum incolumis est, ibi inte<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>gram iubeat custodiri, velut demonstrans, ita futuro in concilio omnia pristinum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in statum reditura, ut nihil reliqui relinquatur, quod nostrae ecclesiae receperunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergenses</placeName> <persName>Mauritio</persName> suo postulanti scripto responderunt, quid <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in isto libello probent vel improbent; quod ad te, si forte legere lubeat aut vacet, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mittendum duxi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Frigidulum est et ad ferendum paratum, quod sine scandalo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tamen ferri et admitti nequit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Multo liberius et, ni fallor, doctius cordatiusque <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>est a ministris <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratensibus</placeName> responsum satis magno volumine, quod vi<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>di tantum potius, quam legi; nam qui ab <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosio Blaurero</persName> acceptum attulerat, repen<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>te abstulit, omni nobis describendi copia denegata.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hunc, oro, ut habeas, cura; <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>habebis autem ab <persName>Ambrosio</persName>, modo volueris.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Mitto et capita actorum comitialium, sed <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ab inerte quodam viciose descripta.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Acta ipsa <placeName ref="l307">Mogunciaci</placeName> prelo excuduntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Excuditur et <placeName ref="l18">Augsutae</placeName> reformatio quaedam, nescio clericorumne an laicorum mores <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et vitam emendatura.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Magni viri arbitrantur, nil aliud futurum, quam spectrum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>fucatissimum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quod ubi nactus fuero, mittam; sed oro interim te, ut remittere illa <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>omnia digneris, quo et ipse queam legere.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Apud <placeName ref="l825">Danos</placeName> et Sarmatas glicit euangeli<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>on, et optime, quod et tu monebas, doctrina Christi habet in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ad quar<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tum diem Iduum Iuliarum Caesar in <placeName ref="l619">Bavariam</placeName> abiit venatum, nescio ferasne an milites <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>feros, quos aiunt clanculum magno numero conscribi, venaturus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Timeo Danaos et do<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>na ferentes.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">utinam bene habeat sylva nec ramos admisceat perfidię, quae et nobis <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tandem incommodet!</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Video enim undique conflatas factiones oppugnandę doctrinae s[a]nae, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quam ferre depravati mores non possunt.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sed suos itidem adversum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>omne carnis brachium tuebitur dominus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p20406">Lienhart Bek</persName> ist gestern alhar gen <placeName ref="l473">S. Gallen</placeName> khommen; hat mir vertru<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>wenlich anzaygt, das die <persName ref="p18538">kay. Mt.</persName> endtlich persuadiert und beredt <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>worden seyge, das Interim werde seinen fuͦß nit steyf setzen noch stellen <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mögen, eß sey dan sach, das die <placeName ref="l862">Schweytzer</placeName> ouch daß selbig anzenemen <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>guͤtenklich oder gwaltenklich gehalten werdind.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Vides hic factionis a<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>trocitatem, quae manibus longissimis extenditur, et vereor, longe a<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>liud papam nostris proponere in comitiis ab illo, quod cum paucis <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>deliberat et decernit in amgulis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Er zaygt ouch an, das kay. Mt. habe zuͦ <placeName ref="l165">Fuͤssen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l907">Kempten</placeName> daselbst <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>harum furrieren und herberg machen laßen aineß weltschen volks, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>so gewüsslich daselbst ankhomen sol.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Mag wol ain zuͦtz sein, die <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>stett <placeName ref="l291">Lindouw</placeName> und <placeName ref="l257">Costentz</placeName> zuͦ schrecken etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>So hat ainer auß <placeName ref="l18">Ougspurg</placeName> alhar geschriben; er zweyfle nur nit, dann <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>daß der <persName ref="p18538">kayser</persName> daß Interim den stetten der <placeName ref="l862">aydgnoschafft</placeName> zuͦzemuͦten ge<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>sinnet sein werde.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Vigilandum ergo nobis et accurate prospiciendum est, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>qua fide mutua pro veritate simus staturi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/><persName ref="p8083">Fortmüller</persName> wil <persName>Voglers</persName> sach gern beruͦben laßen, wil aber khainswegs <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>sich bewegen laßen zuͦ bekennen, das er imm worten oder werkhen halber <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>unrecht thuͦn habe.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de">Mag erß nit leyden, wil er imm zuͦ dem rechten ston.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Ferrers hab ich bey imm nit erholen mögen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Collegas tuos meis verbis salutabis co[mm]endabisque me D. D. consulibus, <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>quos prospere valere summopere cupio.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName> XX die Iulii anno MDXLVI<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>II.</s>
				</p>
