					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/>Longe optimo et doc[tissimo D. <lb xml:id="p2z26"/><persName ref="p495">Hen]rycho Bulling[ero</persName>, ecclesi<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>ae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName>] <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>episcopo, domino su[o colendo].</s>
